		{
			"id": "f640667f0d134095a",
			"markdown": "**SURUCHIN (those-whose-work-is-the-herd) - one stat block for the pack**\n\nOne sheet does for all four dogs, incl. **Qara** (black), the lead bitch and Surubash's own - same breeding, same training, same silence. Grey and liver-brown, long-legged. Bred to turn an aurochs, so a boar does not impress them, and they do not bark on a drive; a bark is reserved for what doesn't belong there.\n\nSee characters/sturm/canon/Yak.md sec.7-8, The_Yol.md, Yol_NPC_Cheatsheet.md; Surubash's own sheet is Surubash.gcs.\n\n**On the point total.** This is a GM-run animal, assigned directly rather than built to a strict player budget - Basic Set's own guidance for animals. The number above is nominal.\n\n**When Surubash wargs Qara**, swap her IQ/Will/skills for his own (see Surubash.gcs notes) - everything else on this sheet stays hers."
		}
	],
